<title>NIGERIA: Half-yr profit dip at Nigeria Cement Co.</title>
<headline>Half-yr profit dip at Nigeria Cement Co.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Cement Company of Northern Nigeria to end-June 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	   1995</p>
<p> Turnover		     360.2  vs    442.2</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    81.8  vs    103.8</p>
<p> Taxation			26.1  vs     36.2</p>
<p> Profit after taxation     55.6  vs     67.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The decline in performance was due to rehabilitation work in some sections of the plant, the company said, adding that an improved result was expected in the second half. ($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
